    "title": "CI failure: Task `riscv32 bare metal, static libbitcoin_consensus`:  submodule cloning rate limited",
    "body": "Not sure what to do about this. Looks like some projects blocked CI machines from cloning their repos.\r\n\r\n\r\n🚧 At least one of the CI tasks failed.\r\n<sub>Task `riscv32 bare metal, static libbitcoin_consensus`: https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/30046119080/job/90826618769</sub>\r\n<sub>LLM reason (✨ experimental): CI failed because submodule cloning of `newlib-cygwin.git` from `sourceware.org` was rate-limited (HTTP 429), causing the base install step to exit with code 2.</sub>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @DrahtBot in https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/issues/35762#issuecomment-5128766803_\r\n            ",
